menuconfig WCH_DRIVERS
	bool "Out-of-tree WCH drivers"
	depends on SOC_CH32V203
	help
	  Enable the external WCH driver module. Initial development targets
	  CH32V203, with CH32V203F8U6 as the first hardware validation target.
	  This initial scaffold contains no peripheral driver implementations.
	  Enabling it does not change the upstream UART or enable USB support.
